WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.200
I've been selling real estate for over 22 years

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.000
and I have a list of things

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.500
I would never do if I'm selling my own house.

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.950
Top of the list is overpricing to test the market.

5
00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.400
This is something you absolutely do not want to do

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.150
because during this first week, this is when you get the most interest.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.900
If you're thinking about selling your home,

8
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.000
send me a DM and I'll send you the complete list.
